564
00:43:28,680 --> 00:43:33,240
<i>I don't think I can hold it back anymore</i>

565
00:43:33,320 --> 00:43:38,640
<i>The closer I am to you,</i>
<i>The more I want to reveal my heart</i>

566
00:43:38,720 --> 00:43:43,760
