<i>My heart shakes even more</i>

567
00:43:44,360 --> 00:43:49,520
<i>It’s just too hard</i>
<i>To keep this love hidden away</i>

568
00:43:49,600 --> 00:43:55,240
<i>And the secret inside your heart</i>
<i>Does it include me at all?</i>

569
00:43:55,840 --> 00:44:02,680
<i>Please tell me what’s in your heart</i>
<i>Let me know</i>

