Phatee! Ranne!

572
00:45:03,720 --> 00:45:05,520
Phatee! Ranne!

573
00:45:05,600 --> 00:45:06,960
Phatee! Ranne!

574
00:45:07,040 --> 00:45:08,400
Phatee! Ranne!

575
00:45:08,480 --> 00:45:09,560
Phatee! Ranne!

